Value slot (\S+)
Value sensor (.+?)
Value sensor_status (\S+)
Value temperature_celsius ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value temperature_high_warning_celsius ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value temperature_high_alarm_celsius ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^\s*Temp:\s+${sensor}\s{2,}${slot}\s+${sensor_status}\s+${temperature_celsius}\s+Celsius\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${sensor} Temperature Value:\s+${temperature_celsius}\s+Degree Celsius
  ^System Temperature State:\s+${sensor_status}
  ^Yellow Threshold\s*:\s+${temperature_high_warning_celsius}
  ^Red Threshold\s*:\s+${temperature_high_alarm_celsius} -> Record
